+| G5 | shipping solution count is exactly 1 by invertibility; demo brute force finds 1/1,331; one shipping reference run used 18,208 field operations |
+| G6 | five attacks, each 0/8; Gauss-Jordan succeeds 8/8 as Track B requires |
+| G7 | doubled (k=128) instance builds and verifies; search-space bit length grows 1,276 to 2,552 |
+| G8 | 80/80 key-invariance and 80/80 carried-witness checks; 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
+| G9(c) | 447 characters, about 112 tokens, 64 atoms, 262 intended operations — all within caps |
+
+## Oracle loop
