Implemented a native Track B generator based on the paper’s S-unit module equations:

- [gen_2505_19141.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2505.19141/gen_2505_19141.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2505.19141/selftest_report.json)
