+    X_j * (c,w) = (c, w + c*a_j)  (all coordinates modulo p).
+
+This action is invertible: X_j^(-1)*(c,w)=(c,w-c*a_j), so every integer
+exponent is defined.  The actions commute.  For an exponent vector
