- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2505.19141/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2505.19141/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Local verification passes all gates:

- 0/200,000 structure-aware random guesses
- Five attacks at 0/8 each
- Gaussian reference: 23,376 field operations
- Compact rank-one route: at most 226 operations
- G8: 300/300 invariance and carried-witness checks
- Answer: 334 characters, 32 elements

The required external hardening remains blocked: every OpenRouter call returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” yielding zero scored oracle attempts. The transcripts record those errors honestly; the family should not be submitted until the OpenRouter allowance is restored and all three harness arms are rerun. The mathematical basis is [Theorem 1.3 and Section 3.3 of the paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.19141).
